title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf context
catalog: CLI command
target: mf context
summary: Log contexts: name the work under way, so what is written in it is one context

!! Reference

```
Log contexts: name the work under way, so what is written in it is one context

Usage: mf context <COMMAND>

Commands:
  new     Create a log context inside the current one and print it, to export as METAFOLDER_LOG_CONTEXT
  parent  Print the context the current one is in, as `new` prints it; 0 at the root
  show    Show a log context (default: the current one) and the contexts it is nested in
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
